+// fused PTQ1_0 gate/up + SWIGLU: op is the gate MUL_MAT; columns tile like the multi-column kernel
+// PQ2_0 multi-column / fused-GLU products. Tiles of at most four columns. M5 sweeps: one simdgroup,
